00:16:42.616 --> 00:16:45.276
<v Jaya Baloo + Jamie Susskind>So in order to get to the data of BICS,

165
00:16:45.936 --> 00:17:00.836
<v Jaya Baloo + Jamie Susskind>instead of going through, like, Five Eyes, Nine Eyes, and all types of different MLAT, mutual legal assistance things, they hacked into BICS, which is part of Belgacom, in order to get to the data of that final target.

